## Theme System

### Dual Theme Support
- **EC Theme**: European Commission (blue primary)
- **EU Theme**: European Union (gold/yellow primary)

### Theme Structure

```
/src/themes/[ec|eu]/
├── theme.scss              # Main export
├── _index.scss             # Theme map builder
├── _variables.scss         # Variable aggregation
├── _custom-properties.scss # CSS vars (~800+ vars)
├── maps/                   # Token categories
│   ├── color.scss         # Color palette
│   ├── typography.scss    # Font system
│   ├── spacing.scss       # Spacing tokens
│   ├── shape.scss         # Border radius
│   ├── layout.scss        # Layout tokens
│   ├── icon.scss          # Icon sizes
│   └── z-index.scss       # Z-index scale
└── variables/              # Component tokens
    ├── _button.scss
    ├── _card.scss
    └── [50+ component files]
```

### Design Token Categories

**Color System**:
- Primary (25-950): Main brand color
- Secondary (25-950): Secondary brand color
- Neutral (25-950): Blue-grey tones
- Grey (25-950): True greys
- Monochrome (25-950): Black to white
- Status: info, success, error, warning (each 25-950)
- Extended: 13 additional color families

**Color Modes** (15 modes):
- Semantic tokens: `--cm-surface-primary`, `--cm-on-surface-inverted`
- Uses CSS `color-mix()` for transparency
- Each mode: surface, on-surface, border tokens

**Typography Tokens**:
- Font family: Inter Variable
- Weights: 400 (regular), 500 (medium), 600 (semibold), 700 (bold)
- Responsive size scales
- Line heights & letter spacing

**Spacing Scale**:
```
--s-4xs, --s-3xs, --s-2xs, --s-xs, --s-s, --s-m,
--s-l, --s-xl, --s-2xl, --s-3xl, --s-4xl
```

### Theme Application

Themes are passed to components via Sass module configuration:

```scss
// In preset: src/presets/ec/src/ec.scss
@use '@ecl/theme-ec/theme' as theme;
@use '@ecl/theme-ec/variables' as var;

@use '@ecl/button/button' with (
  $theme: theme.$theme,
  $button: var.$button
);
```

