## Build System

### Custom ECL Builder

**Location**: `/src/tools/builder/`

**Tech Stack**:
- Rollup 4.53.3 (bundling)
- Sass 1.94.2 (SCSS compilation)
- Babel 7.28.5 (transpilation)
- PostCSS 8.5.6 (processing)
- Autoprefixer 10.4.22 (prefixing)
- cssnano 7.1.2 (minification)
- Browser-sync 3.0.4 (dev server)

**Configuration** (`ecl-builder.config.js`):
```javascript
module.exports = {
  scripts: [
    { entry: 'src/ec.js', dest: 'scripts/ecl-ec.js', format: 'iife' },
    { entry: 'src/ec-esm.js', dest: 'scripts/ecl-esm-ec.js', format: 'es' }
  ],
  styles: [
    { entry: 'src/ec.scss', dest: 'styles/ecl-ec.css' },
    { entry: 'src/ec-print.scss', dest: 'styles/ecl-ec-print.css' }
  ],
  copy: [
    { from: '../resources/logo/logo--ec.svg', to: 'images/' }
  ],
  watch: {
    scripts: './src/**/*.js',
    styles: './src/**/*.scss',
    copy: '../resources/**/*'
  }
};
```

### Asset Pipeline

**SCSS Processing**:
1. Sass compilation with module system
2. PostCSS with Autoprefixer
3. Minification with cssnano
4. Source maps generation

**JavaScript Processing**:
1. Rollup bundling (IIFE & ESM)
2. Babel transpilation (>1% browsers)
3. Tree-shaking
4. Banner injection with version

