## Troubleshooting

### Build Errors

**"Cannot find module '@ecl/...'"**
- Run `pnpm install` to ensure all workspace links are created
- Check package.json dependencies

**"SassError: Undefined variable"**
- Ensure theme is passed to component via `@use ... with ()`
- Check variable name in theme files

**"Circular dependency detected"**
- Review `@use` and `@forward` chain
- Avoid importing components that import each other

### Storybook Issues

**"Story not showing"**
- Check story file exports default config
- Verify story function naming
- Check console for template errors

**"Twig template error"**
- Validate Twig syntax
- Check parameter names match demo data
- Ensure includes use correct path

### Test Failures

**"Snapshot mismatch"**
- Review changes in diff
- If intentional: `npm run test:components -- [component] -u`

**"Accessibility violations"**
- Check jest-axe error details
- Fix semantic HTML issues
- Ensure proper ARIA attributes

